-------------------------------------
Periodic Summary ({current_time_str})
-------------------------------------
Conversation Duration: {timedelta(seconds=conv_duration)}
Messages Exchanged: {len(conv_messages) // 2 if conv_messages else 0} rounds
Wakefulness Assessment: {'User appears awake' if is_awake else 'User still seems sleepy/unconvinced'}
